{"html":"<h1 id=\"download-run-and-share\">Download, run and share</h1>\n<h2 id=\"start-in-the-browser\">Start in the browser</h2>\n<p><a href=\"./guide.html\">Open the runnable guide</a>. For releases with a browser compiler, the site downloads it automatically. Supported programs compile and run on your device, without a compilation backend.</p>\n<p>Unsupported browser capabilities report exact errors; there is no server-side execution fallback.</p>\n<h2 id=\"download-the-native-compiler\">Download the native compiler</h2>\n<p>Choose once with the page-wide version selector. The matching compiler packages and checksums appear below.</p>\n<section class=\"release-panel\" data-release-version=\"0.4.5\"><p><strong>VKF 0.4.5</strong></p><div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"VKF 0.4.5 compiler downloads\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Platform</th><th scope=\"col\">Package</th><th scope=\"col\">Portable archive</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Windows x64</td><td><a href=\"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.5/vektor-flow-windows-x64-setup.exe?sha256=d3993fbda40ad15b19cde10f01770b2d096e7e1f3c8e4f1eb48bcc373b82790d\">Setup</a></td><td><a href=\"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.5/vektor-flow-windows-x64.zip?sha256=a45163aeb32da41b9b8898c8efa77f3970624819b259ad722bb957729ae1d2c3\">ZIP</a></td></tr><tr><td>Linux x64</td><td><a href=\"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.5/vektor-flow-linux-x64.deb?sha256=e8982c4ca8cd5295512303fd53903a117ada6f8bcc06d8ad48e05b4afb244da8\">Debian/Ubuntu</a></td><td><a href=\"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.5/vektor-flow-linux-x64.tar.gz?sha256=500c8cfc455315584efbcd2966dadb1a0fc7fe452b10400f8c64d1cf31fa22e9\">tar.gz</a></td></tr><tr><td>macOS Apple Silicon</td><td><a href=\"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.5/vektor-flow-macos-arm64.pkg?sha256=c80a137a805cc1f2200b41961af6903950338ff17839ce69969f44bfa1b635b4\">Package</a></td><td><a href=\"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.5/vektor-f